                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "56e5f0b8-3fbe-3e56-a7f6-f9c140168c05",
                        "entry_id": "280695b9-c366-3d30-ad55-f0efd8ad7512",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A talented rapper, on the same level as the rapper Eminem."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "99de407f-61c5-436e-a916-97c7ef2b7f46",
                                "sense_id": "56e5f0b8-3fbe-3e56-a7f6-f9c140168c05",
                                "text": "Of her husband, now a successful attorney, she says: \"He's no Eminem, but he's not a buck-toothed, tractor-driving white boy either. He's a cool, worldly dude."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f7a32c9-433c-4f54-9256-da48c7f68c24",
                                "sense_id": "56e5f0b8-3fbe-3e56-a7f6-f9c140168c05",
                                "text": "In an early song that did not end up on his album, I Don't Know, he responded to critics who compared him to the white rapper Eminem. I'm no Eminem / but I'm not wack either / The only reason you compare me to him / Is because I'm not black either."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3422b32-e991-43f0-9b1e-08b915ea2608",
                                "sense_id": "56e5f0b8-3fbe-3e56-a7f6-f9c140168c05",
                                "text": "This is the entry point for all the Eminems, and for all the Eminems to come"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4760338-6f7a-4d93-a6f4-fe6c5907f580",
                                "sense_id": "56e5f0b8-3fbe-3e56-a7f6-f9c140168c05",
                                "text": "Rocky was no Eminem."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7d8745a-0a62-43b3-a8c8-2dd4ffffc6e0",
                                "sense_id": "56e5f0b8-3fbe-3e56-a7f6-f9c140168c05",
                                "text": "All I know is: I'm no Eminem, and I want nothing to do with a cypher, even though all of these guys (and one chick) are looking at me expectantly like, Why wouldn't dude want to join in?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
